+# Today
+
+A small to-do list that stores tasks in this browser on this device. It needs no install or network connection.
+
+## Run
+
+Run `python3 -m http.server 8000` from this folder and open <http://localhost:8000>. The app starts with an empty list. Tasks remain saved in the browser's local storage after reloads.
+
+## Check
+
+Run `node --test tests/todo.test.js` to check adding nonblank tasks, completing and reopening tasks, deleting tasks, saved state after reload, and malformed saved data.
